#: krunnerapp.cpp:307
msgid ""
"Could not log out properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace; note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Ne povis elsaluti ĝuste.\n"
"Ne povas konektiĝi al la seancadministrilo. Vi povas peni devigi "
"sistemfermon per premo de Ctrl+Alt+retropaŝa klavo; notu ke via nuna seanco "
"ne estos konservita dum deviga sistemfermo."

